{"id":"mechta","lemma":"мечта","pos":"noun","rank":1238,"glosses":["fantasy, daydream","dream (act or habit of imagining something, usually intensely but often unrealistically desired; something thus imagined)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/01/Ru-%D0%BC%D0%B5%D1%87%D1%82%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D0%BC%D0%B5%D1%87%D1%82%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"мечты","plural":"мечты"},"examples":[{"text":"Ты девушка моей мечты.","en":"You're the girl of my dreams.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"girl, lass"},{"g":"my, mine","l":"мой"},null]},{"text":"Это была моя мечта.","en":"It was my dream.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"my","l":"мой"},null]},{"text":"Он был мужчиной её мечты.","en":"He was the man of her dreams.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null,{"g":"her"},null]},{"text":"Это всего лишь мечта.","en":"It's just a dream.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[1,3,"only, no more than"]]},{"text":"Это была работа мечты.","en":"It was a dream job.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"work"},null]}]}